# Index × Granola

This is a working instrument, not a landing page. The bar is Linear, Granola, and a YC company that ships: cream paper, olive, Newsreader, yellow highlighter, steel, red Index cap. Every surface should feel like a physical object. Sexy, useful, practical. If it looks like AI slop, redo it.

## Objects

- Afterthought is a Granola note (cream, olive spine, live yellow highlighter).
- Prep me is one Index e-paper card (steel rim, red INDEX).
- What I owe is a You / Them ledger with ruled columns. The name field is an optional filter, not a form.
- Pair the ring stays in the steel side panel.

One object per tool. No WebGL, no spinning torus, no clipped 3D, no card stacks.

## Chrome

- Copy is the word Copy, then Copied. No icons, toasts, emoji, or "Copied to clipboard!".
- No sample utterances, fake ledger rows, or marketing blurbs in the feature UI.
- No purple AI, no Inter-on-white SaaS, no gradient orbs, no delight microcopy.
- No em dashes (U+2014). Use an en dash, a comma, or a new sentence.
